SUMMARY:Learn to Swing Dance + 2 Hours of Social Dancing
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\nLet's go to Asheville Swing Ni
 ght on Friday Sept 11th for an evening of swing dancing\, great music\, an
 d a fun beginner-friendly lesson. 💃🕺\n\nThe instructors (Jared & Mar
 guerite) will kick things off at 7PM with the beginner fundamentals so eve
 ryone can learn the basic footwork and get comfortable with swing dancing.
  🎶\n\nNo partner needed. During both the lesson and social dance\, most
  people rotate partners\, making it a fun way to meet people and get comfo
 rtable in the space.\n\n(Most people come alone\, by the way.)\n\n**What d
 ance are we learning?**\nIntro Lindy Hop and East Coast Swing.\n\n**How ma
 ny people will be there?**\nThroughout the night there are usually 50–70
  people who attend. The lesson and dance is open to the public\, not just 
 this Meetup group.\n\n**What should I wear?**\nWear shoes that are comfort
 able to dance in. Heels are not recommended. Leather-soled shoes or comfor
 table sneakers are best. Dressing up is optional — people wear everythin
 g from casual to vintage-inspired outfits.\n\n**Does the Meetup group sit 
 together all evening?**\nOnce the lesson starts\, the Meetup group dispers
 es to take the lesson with everyone else. The lesson is immediately follow
 ed by a social dance. In our experience\, some of the Meetup attendees con
 tinue to sit together\, chat\, and listen to the music. Others (including 
 the hosts) will be gone dancing and mingling around the room.\n\n**Logisti
 cs**\n📍 Location: Haw Creek Commons\nParking is onsite\, or at Haw Cree
 k Elementary if the parking lot is full. Just walk across the field to the
  venue.\n\n🕖 7PM sharp — Beginner swing dance lesson\n(Please arrive 
 on time\, as the lesson builds progressively and is harder to join late if
  you're brand new.)\n\n💃🕺 8-10:00PM — Social dance with DJ\n\n💵
  $10 admission includes both the lesson and dance\nPay at the door (cash o
 r Venmo)\n\n🚪 Doors open at 6:45 PM\n\n👥 Ages 12+\n\n**More Info:**\
 nFacebook Event:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/1470766331735914\n\nWebs
 ite: [https://ashevilleswingnight.com/](https://ashevilleswingnight.com/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /316300396/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260827T180611Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260827T180611Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
