SUMMARY:Anberlin Concert @ Eulogy 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\nAnberlin concert at Eulogy. Ti
 ckets cost $40. Openers seem to be Fantømex & snakesnakewhale\n\nAnberlin
  is a mid 2000s rock band with a mix of Emo/Alt Rock. Feel Good Drag - htt
 ps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BJQNBxC6nUQ\n\nTickets: https://dice.fm/event
 /wwmlqp-anberlin-with-fantmex-snakesnakewhale-21st-sep-eulogy-asheville-ti
 ckets?cid1=&cid2=43304056&pid=f5e6ac52&_branch_match_id=144372708513215704
 3&utm_medium=partners_api&_branch_referrer=H4sIAAAAAAAAAwXBSwqAIBAA0Nu01PB
 LgbToIJE61lCWjFK7zt57e2uljpyfeB0sYgCWMn%2BsHqII3nqRpoBROCVlr3ptuoLRJQ1mDVp
 0H0ECIry2xdP9ViA373Rn%2BAFc1h6aVgAAAA%3D%3D
